# ---- divergence D24: an operand that reads no value, over an INNER join back ----

# A value conjunct computes its other operands above its join back. Over SUM the join back is INNER, so cities 4 to 6
# never reach the cast: antb1 answers 1 2 3, and DuckDB fails. Both engines fail where the value is a direct operand
# (its outer side is computed below the join back) and over COUNT (the join back is LEFT).
